        "Cumulative native returned mass/elements/energy increments equal the sum of committed per-source operations between actual saved epochs",
        "Exact uint64 source counter difference equals committed consecutive source-operation census; bound native model CRC and nonregressing source clocks",
        "Initial locked SSP mass equals current retained SSP mass plus cumulative delayed returned mass; SH03 prompt return is outside this retained reservoir"
      ],
      "physical_assumptions": [
        "Pinned instantaneous SH03 prompt recycling; birth gross mass is bookkeeping associated with net retained mass, not an extra native gas transfer",
        "Birth metallicity is a mass fraction frozen at conversion; subsequent enrichment cannot change it",
        "Version zero is unavailable legacy birth state; no ID or epoch reconstructed from row order"
      ],
      "numerical_domain": [
        "Native IDS_64BIT, comoving snapshots with explicit UnitMass_in_g/HubbleParam/FactorSN",
        "Declared memory limit, complete native snapshot publication, exact uint64 parents/counters",
